WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.660
Adventurer Forrest Galante was blown away&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:10.620
witnessing pajama sharks mating&nbsp;
off the coast of South Africa.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:19.020
These rare so-called alien sharks are uniquely&nbsp;
found in this region and hunt using their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:25.500
sense of smell. Galante encountered several&nbsp;
while diving in the great African sea Forest.

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:39.420
This was the first time he&nbsp;
had seen active shark mating.

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:54.540
If the mating is successful, the female&nbsp;
will lay a fertilized egg on the sea floor.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:59.220
In about six months, a young&nbsp;
pajama shark will hopefully emerge.

